ardson's comic and Sebastian  Maniscalco as Spike the Mario movie was  originally lined up for release in  December this year before it was delayed  to April 7 2023 pratta said his Mario  voices quote unlike anything you've ever  heard and I bet that that is the case  and that is it for today's Gamespot news  which CD project red title excites you  the most are you excited to see your  first look at the Super Mario Bros movie  let us know in the comments below and  we'll see you here tomorrow for more  Gamespot news
 

